{"2886490": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Dawn Of Fear", "steam_appid": 2886490, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886490/extras/ad374370521ee35689761b9ff1037f11.avif?t=1774839733\" width=800 height=374 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>STORY</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Belgrade, 2024: Tim Felix</strong> and <strong>Robin Baker</strong>, agents of the <strong>FIT (Federal Investigation Team)</strong>, are assigned to investigate disturbing rumors about a dark cult spreading curses among the residents of a village long believed to be abandoned.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The group is allegedly led by a notorious figure from the past known as <span class=\"bb_strike\"><i><strong>Fiasco</strong></i></span>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With limited resources and almost no intelligence available, the two agents enter the village with no idea what awaits them. What begins as a simple investigation quickly turns into something far more disturbing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886490/extras/3b8cee9fd65d92c2e620a950bc0c73d2.poster.avif?t=1774839733\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886490/extras/3b8cee9fd65d92c2e620a950bc0c73d2.webm?t=1774839733\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886490/extras/3b8cee9fd65d92c2e620a950bc0c73d2.mp4?t=1774839733\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>EXPLORE &quot;LINCOLN&quot;, THE VILLAGE</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tim Felix</strong> must traverse the <strong>four regions of the village</strong>, each controlled by different leaders, hiding new dangers, secrets, and clues that lead closer to <strong><i><span class=\"bb_strike\">Fiasco's location</span></i></strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every path may lead to answers… or something far worse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886490/extras/62526f46b8a8ff6767a8b87fe3dbe08d.avif?t=1774839733\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>SURVIVE THE EXPERIMENTS</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The deeper <strong>Tim</strong> goes into the village, the more hostile the environment becomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strange creatures roam the area, while <span class=\"bb_strike\"><strong>possessed forces</strong></span> begin to blur the line between reality and nightmare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886490/extras/d0af378ecd3c7b1a2cc8debbc80410ae.avif?t=1774839733\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i><strong>Uncover the full mystery behind Fiasco's twisted plan.</strong></i></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Gameplay Highlights:</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First-Person Action Shooter. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Huge Variety of Enemies. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open-World Exploration with Side Puzzles (for each chapter).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hardcore Mode (New Game+)</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_par